{
  "version": 1,
  "verified": "2026-11-13",
  "sources": [
    "《图解无源光子器件 Vol.01丨一束光，怎么被“掰”成两路？》mp.weixin.qq.com/s/d_BloK63Wrv6hBWb8lhIwg",
    "《图解无源光子器件 Vol.02丨两条波导靠得够近，光就自己换手》mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ZJJI_X8RcEMO1EbkPC_olQ"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "公众号稿的唯一样式来源：tools/wechat.py 读取本文件生成内联样式，不再从浏览器 computed style 反推。",
    "取值来自两篇发布版的内联样式实测；两篇冲突处以较新的 Vol.02 为准，差异见 docs/wechat-template.md 第五节。",
    "预览稿仍用 tools/style.css；两者共享的取值由 tests/test_wechat.py 对齐，不共享的只有 h3 字号（公众号稿把 h2 换成了横幅图，h3 要顶到 18px）。"
  ],
  "tokens": {
    "brand": "#0B4C9C",
    "rule": "#2E7FD1",
    "ink": "#2C4459",
    "heading": "#12263A",
    "muted": "#6C8195",
    "chip": "#EAF3FD",
    "wash": "#F3F7FC",
    "eq-wash": "#F6FAFE",
    "eq-rule": "#9EC4E8",
    "row-rule": "#EDF3F9",
    "row-wash": "#FAFCFF",
    "head-rule": "#CBE0F5",
    "shadow": "0 6px 22px rgba(18,60,110,.1)",
    "font": "-apple-system, system-ui, \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif",
    "serif": "Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif",
    "mono": "ui-monospace, \"SFMono-Regular\", Consolas, \"Liberation Mono\", monospace"
  },
  "elements": {
    "root": {
      "font-family": "{font}",
      "font-size": "15px",
      "line-height": "1.75",
      "color": "{ink}",
      "margin": "0",
      "padding": "0"
    },
    "p": {
      "margin": "17px 0",
      "font-size": "15px",
      "line-height": "1.75",
      "color": "{ink}"
    },
    "h3": {
      "margin": "36px 0 12px",
      "padding-left": "13px",
      "border-left": "4px solid {rule}",
      "color": "{heading}",
      "font-size": "18px",
      "font-weight": "bold",
      "line-height": "1.5"
    },
    "strong": {
      "color": "{brand}",
      "font-weight": "600"
    },
    "a": {
      "color": "{brand}",
      "text-decoration": "none",
      "overflow-wrap": "anywhere"
    },
    "ul": {
      "margin": "16px 0",
      "padding-left": "0",
      "list-style": "none"
    },
    "ol": {
      "margin": "16px 0",
      "padding-left": "0",
      "list-style": "none"
    },
    "li": {
      "margin": "9px 0",
      "padding-left": "22px",
      "color": "{ink}"
    },
    "figure": {
      "margin": "30px 0 26px"
    },
    "img": {
      "display": "block",
      "width": "100%",
      "max-width": "100%",
      "height": "auto",
      "border-radius": "12px",
      "box-shadow": "{shadow}"
    },
    "plate": {
      "display": "block",
      "width": "100%",
      "max-width": "100%",
      "height": "auto"
    },
    "figcaption": {
      "margin-top": "11px",
      "color": "{muted}",
      "font-size": "13px",
      "line-height": "1.75"
    },
    "fig-tag": {
      "display": "inline-block",
      "margin-right": "7px",
      "padding": "1px 8px",
      "border-radius": "5px",
      "background": "{chip}",
      "color": "{brand}",
      "font-size": "12px",
      "letter-spacing": ".04em"
    },
    "eq": {
      "margin": "24px 0",
      "padding": "15px 18px 14px",
      "background": "{eq-wash}",
      "border-left": "3px solid {eq-rule}",
      "border-radius": "0 10px 10px 0",
      "color": "{heading}",
      "font-family": "{serif}",
      "font-size": "16px",
      "line-height": "2.05",
      "letter-spacing": ".01em",
      "text-align": "center"
    },
    "note": {
      "color": "{muted}",
      "font-size": "14px",
      "font-style": "italic"
    },
    "greek": {
      "font-family": "{serif}",
      "font-style": "italic"
    },
    "table": {
      "width": "100%",
      "border-collapse": "collapse",
      "margin": "24px 0 20px",
      "font-size": "14.5px",
      "line-height": "1.7",
      "font-feature-settings": "\"tnum\""
    },
    "th": {
      "padding": "9px 11px",
      "border-bottom": "1.5px solid {head-rule}",
      "background": "{chip}",
      "color": "{brand}",
      "font-size": "13px",
      "font-weight": "600",
      "letter-spacing": ".03em",
      "text-align": "left",
      "vertical-align": "top"
    },
    "th-nowrap": {
      "white-space": "nowrap"
    },
    "td": {
      "padding": "9px 11px",
      "border-bottom": "1px solid {row-rule}",
      "color": "{ink}",
      "vertical-align": "top",
      "overflow-wrap": "anywhere"
    },
    "td-zebra": {
      "background": "{row-wash}"
    },
    "td-last": {
      "border-bottom": "none"
    },
    "blockquote": {
      "margin": "24px 0",
      "padding": "4px 18px",
      "border-left": "3px solid {rule}",
      "background": "{wash}"
    },
    "pre": {
      "margin": "17px 0",
      "padding": "14px",
      "background": "{wash}",
      "font-family": "{mono}",
      "font-size": "13px",
      "white-space": "pre-wrap",
      "overflow-wrap": "anywhere"
    },
    "code": {
      "font-family": "{mono}",
      "font-size": "13px"
    },
    "follow": {
      "text-align": "center"
    },
    "banner": {
      "text-align": "center",
      "margin-top": "40px",
      "margin-bottom": "0"
    },
    "case": {
      "text-align": "center",
      "margin-bottom": "0"
    },
    "plate-section": {
      "text-align": "center"
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "max_nowrap_columns": 3,
    "min_body_font_px": 15,
    "max_heading_chars": 18
  }
}
